  m_text: "\tThe mage class represents a character with great mental prowess, intellect,
    willpower, discipline, concentration and knowledge. They often serve as the artillery,
    mobilizers, controllers and offensive support for their allies.\r\n\tIn battle,
    mage can deal devastating attacks against many foes at once and they can manipulate
    the terrain of the battlefield in order to support allies or hinder enemies. "
