  m_text: "\tMasterfully owns swords, axes and spears.\n\n\tHe has no equal in strength,
    can withstand a large number of blows, in response to striking back in close
    combat. He can also wield bows and crossbows, but is inferior in skill to an
    archer. Can't stand magic.\n\n\tCan attack while on horseback"
