  m_text: "\tArchers are skilled bowmen. Generally independent and used to working
    alone, this tends to make them practical, a little haughty or arrogant and not
    the best at following orders, especially from those they don't respect.\n\tDue
    to the nature of their weapon, archers are typically stealthy and graceful and
    tend to fight at a distance."
