  m_text: "\tNobody lives in the village, the traveler assures us.\nBut recently
    he heard screams coming from a small tower under the hill.\n\nYou should find
    this tower and find the source of the screams.\n\nIt is better not to go such
    a task alone. monsters can attack from anywhere."
