  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\tIn battle, assassins can deal large amounts of damage against a single
    target at a time and they are\r\nincredibly mobile, with abilities that allow
    them to move unhindered by most obstacles and difficult terrain. This allows
    them to maneuver swiftly across the battle field and report back to their allies.\n\tBe
    they a silent assassin, tricky thief or agile scout, the ranger uses their agility
    and speed to outmaneuver and outflank foes and even catch them off guard when
    and where they are most vulnerable."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: acff0833ad4513f40b18543cd98f169a, type: 2}
